This web port cannot perform WiFi, cellular, GNSS-jam, USB-WiFi probe, or
background BLE scans that a native Android app can. Browsers also hide
Bluetooth addresses, so OUI prefix matches usually need EXOpace / ESP32
hardware that reports a real MAC. The UI must never invent detections.
